Ben, şey…

575
00:37:58,943 --> 00:38:00,319
Erin, bekle.

576
00:38:01,279 --> 00:38:02,530
Tebrikler.

577
00:38:02,613 --> 00:38:04,573
Evet. Teşekkürler.

